RNAplfold: arithmetic mean of probabilities (is not correct! since we would need geometric mean)
==> INTERSESTING SIDE PROJECT: RNAplfold with geometric means

by using RNAplfold, we can use entire mRNAs and restrict interaction sites to some tails.
==> Extend UnpairedPF.hh

Criteria for pruning:

  - transition rate < th_tr                        ==> remove edge
  - equilibrium probability < th_eq (e.g. < 1e-10) ==> resolve state
  - outflow > th_o (number or quantile based)      ==> resolve state

